Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：半决赛 第2回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.43,0:00:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}展开激斗的 海斗与特隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.73,0:00:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然而在决斗中 攻击特隆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得知等同于 给哈尔特造成伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被逼入绝境的海斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 终于特隆的猛烈反击开始了！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)上吧 基因人·地狱使者！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:19.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.89,0:00:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心之地)什 什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个 戴森球{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.40,0:00:39.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被基因人·地狱使者
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给破坏掉了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.43,0:00:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}形势逆转！ 特隆占优！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:47.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一瞬间就被逼入绝境的海斗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.27,0:00:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆 真有一套呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)那个 戴森球竟然…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)而且 海斗的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从刚才开始就很奇怪啊乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:00:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)是不是出了什么事……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.02,0:01:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……你懂的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的痛就是特隆的痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.71,0:01:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆的痛就是我的痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.95,0:01:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.26,0:01:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:24.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只给哥哥特别放映哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手 你这混蛋～！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:46.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋～打算把哈鲁特怎么样！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！哈鲁特～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 轮到哥哥了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.12,0:03:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以哦 来攻击我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用哥哥的银河之眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你觉得心爱的哈鲁特变成怎样都无所谓的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《要是攻击那家伙 哈露特就会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可要是我输了……》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.25,0:03:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我只能赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非赢不可！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打倒这家伙 救出哈露特！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 在那之前你要撑住 哈露特！》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.47,0:04:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 银河眼·光子·龙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.34,0:04:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击纹章王 杰诺姆·海利塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破灭的光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太过分了…… 太过分了 哥哥……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.18,0:04:35.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}杰诺姆·海利塔在非 No.卡的对战中
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然不会被破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但我会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:41.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 哥哥他{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了目的什么手段都使得出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是个过分的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.20,0:04:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 到此 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 就不能飞得再快点吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话，哈鲁特就！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(欧贝利特7)顿马！ 你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:04:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不用你说我也知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:04:59.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冲进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.89,0:05:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抓紧了哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 万全的安全系统
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.55,0:05:15.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}启动了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥 因为是我的回合所以没法攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.26,0:05:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你很失望吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系的。我不会让哥哥失望的。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:35.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 装备魔法 诅咒人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备到 基因人偶·赫利塔上！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家每回合一次{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.32,0:05:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上每有一只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:45.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就受到300点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.78,0:05:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上有两只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此我们兄弟俩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会受到600点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起哦，哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥，哥……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.95,0:06:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.74,0:06:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不该如此绝不该如此啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:34.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，哈鲁特，振作点！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.41,0:06:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特，哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！你没事！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.28,0:06:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特还活着！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.71,0:06:58.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听得见吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:02.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗，哈鲁特他……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.63,0:07:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈……！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.30,0:07:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上当了，上当了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵……吓到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为已经没救了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.61,0:07:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.69,0:07:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈 别这样嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.95,0:07:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是开个小玩笑而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 接下来才是关键。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧 爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你给我适可而止！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特明明什么都没做！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特只是想和凯特在一起而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特也一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只是想救你。心里只想着你……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可为什么…… 哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:51.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.85,0:08:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.84,0:08:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那时候一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.26,0:08:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((游马 你们的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:22.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就知道你们一定会来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没办法离开这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.47,0:08:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}求求你们，救救我哥哥。))
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:34.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，这里是哈尔特的意识之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.41,0:08:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是之前哈尔特把你叫进来的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.29,0:08:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:08:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么，为什么你会在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是躲在哈尔特里面赖着不走吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总是碍手碍脚的烦人的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.51,0:09:46.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了，霍……什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:09:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙竟敢对哈鲁特的心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为所欲为，我怎么可能忍得了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:06.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～ 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把盘踞在哈鲁特体内的邪恶之根斩断～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干掉了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.35,0:10:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马… 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}十马～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.25,0:10:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该死的 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你处处碍事～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:58.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.55,0:10:59.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:02.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！我把待在哈鲁特体内的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆的意识给收拾掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特已经不再和特隆连着了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.54,0:11:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放心吧 凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 把那家伙打趴下～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.13,0:11:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独你我绝不可原谅…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.36,0:11:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做好忏悔的准备了吗…！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.65,0:11:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特大人 加油～！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.65,0:11:32.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 凯特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.57,0:11:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们无论到哪都不会
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.96,0:11:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如我所愿呢…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开什么玩笑…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唯独你我绝不原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.17,0:11:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.47,0:11:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河远征！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当我场上有银河眼存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从卡组将1只银河骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 当我场上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有1只银河骑士存在时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.59,0:12:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.17,0:12:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将另一只银河骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊，快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级8的银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和两只银河骑士叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}翻涌的银河啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:29.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此刻化作怒涛之光现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧，我的灵魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼光子龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙就是银河眼的进化形态……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 当银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:08.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功召唤出新银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:12.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其他所有怪兽效果无效化！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光子送葬！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）基因人·遗产的效果发动了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.13,0:13:24.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的怪兽就只是些废物人偶！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说这样就能破坏 No.卡了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:34.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 只要这次攻击成功快斗就赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多隆！就算你求饶一百万次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.44,0:13:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怒火也不会平息！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}地狱也好 异世界也罢！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从我和哈鲁特面前 消失吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.29,0:13:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对基因人·遗产发动攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终极光子流！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:58.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.55,0:14:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了 快斗大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干得好 不愧是… 嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（多隆）哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.57,0:14:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.36,0:14:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为已经打败我了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我对 新·银河眼 发动了永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.48,0:14:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护·子午线哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 通过保护·子午线{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将新·银河眼的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降低了800点哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.84,0:14:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 才没能将托隆的生命值削减干净吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.43,0:14:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 来吧 快斗 你打算怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 谢谢你 快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.03,0:15:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切都多亏了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的愤怒 将沉睡的纹章神{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:09.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唤醒了我～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！我的回合，抽牌！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:22.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤纹章兽 伯纳斯猎鹰！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动魔法卡 死者苏生·梅达利翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以从墓地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:34.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4以下的纹章怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我特殊召唤纹章兽 蛇怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此外，当我场上有2只以上纹章怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.56,0:15:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌将纹章兽 飞鹰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的伯纳斯猎鹰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蛇怪 飞鹰进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.42,0:16:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}释放吧，愤怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.01,0:16:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多隆)现身吧，No.69！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)神·梅达利翁 武装之袍！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？ 这个 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)要操控这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}需要庞大的能量。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.74,0:16:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愤怒。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愤怒？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.10,0:16:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错！ 我没有感情。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有纯粹的愤怒。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我让大家替我愤怒。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:17:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}利用多洛瓦和夏克 还有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}甚至连我的儿子们也用上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直积攒着愤怒。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你 可是经常替我发怒啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.55,0:17:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一提到哈鲁特的事 就怒不可遏。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.06,0:17:15.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了你 你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.12,0:17:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能召唤出武装之袍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.17,0:17:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 这一切都是为了召唤这个 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((要是做了这种事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 我的灵魂！))
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.67,0:17:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 臂之外套
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即使不使用超量单元也能发动效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的 除此之外的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.03,0:17:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所持有的效果 全部无效{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:50.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 那些效果 全部获得！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.59,0:17:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上 臂之外套！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.87,0:17:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺取新银河眼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之勋章手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(托隆)这样一来 你的怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部消失{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归我所有。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.55,0:18:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.29,0:18:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.84,0:18:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗大人～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，要上了。快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:39.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轰）我从新银河眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.57,0:18:41.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动夺来的怪兽效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量单元，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将盾徽以外的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送去墓地！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由此，
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盾徽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每1个超量单元
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:18:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，攻击力上升1500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，盾徽可以{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量单元的数量，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对怪兽进行相应次数的攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，是3次连续攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.12,0:19:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由于保护·勋章的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新·银河眼不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你彻底品尝殆尽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.26,0:19:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 发动费卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:33.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我好好看着！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.23,0:19:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看你儿子痛苦挣扎的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(嘲讽)哈哈哈哈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.73,0:19:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用武器之衣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:46.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击新·银河眼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈尔特…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完!!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.43,0:20:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我还不让你倒下。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.84,0:20:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你的愤怒可不止这种程度吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.30,0:20:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:37.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:49.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.10,0:20:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会… 你！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥… 谢谢你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.98,0:21:16.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.50,0:21:33.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把仅剩的一点力量用在了哥哥身上吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不妙不妙。真是不妙的复仇啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.78,0:21:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特！ 凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.88,0:21:53.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 振作点！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特 凯特！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凯特～！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
